  Content: "The KIAC Back Porch becomes a living canvas this year! Join visiting
    Whitehorse artist Gorellaume for a collaborative mural painting\u2014add a splash,
    swirl, or signature to this ever-growing work. It\u2019s art in motion, shared
    under open skies and surrounded by community creativity. Brushes welcome, judgment
    not included."
  RavenSucessScript: KIAC Back Porch! Cozy, caw-laborative, and absolutely caw-some.
